  <item>
    <title>Ep.6 聊聊浏览器发展史与我们为什么看好 Arc</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/638ca5b0f6753f4e9d4d5f36</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">638ca5b0f6753f4e9d4d5f36</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Dec 2022 13:50:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期播客提供纯文字版本</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://cali.so/kjsyp-ep6-transcript" data-url="https://cali.so/kjsyp-ep6-transcript"><span>cali.so</span></a></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>// 关于</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>「佐声道」出品的科技双眼啤，由开发者 Cali 与设计师 Rather 共同主持，我们是从设计到开发等不同的视角对互联网软件硬件进行深入探讨的科技播客。佐声道主理人 Cali 在留美期间有丰富的工作经验，对于产品有极度的热爱以及不同的体验经历；设计师 Rather 一直在国内从事着 UI 设计师的工作，并在这一行有着不同的独特见解。同为苹果粉的两人一拍即合，他们也将自己对于产品的解读认知、对设计的严谨态度都延续到了他们所有的节目当中。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>在此期播客中，我们一起探索过去的浏览器历史，以及我们到底需要一款什么样的浏览器，最后关于我们为什么看好 Arc 浏览器的前景。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大家不妨在评论区留言告诉我们，你们在用什么浏览器呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-U0oIpUVSYjgscLVZyvT84_T_5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>// 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 第一次拨号上网</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">09:37</a> 第一次使用 Google Chrome</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 全球浏览器的排位赛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> “永远的”老大 Chromium？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 三剑客之一 Firefox？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 开发者友好浏览器 Sizzy？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 终于“弃暗投明”的 Microsoft Edge？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 一个月30刀的 Mighty？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2426">40:26</a> 小清流零重力浏览器 - Moonvy</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2537">42:17</a> 浏览器的哪些功能吸引我们</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a> 小而美个性十足的 Arc</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>// 相关链接</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>浏览器份额</span><a href="https://docs.craft.do/editor/d/4ebbb84e-8aca-be8a-3f1a-37ed54e0241f/82FCE7E9-0302-486D-A302-7DC2ECB1551F/b/54049712-BCCF-44CA-877C-7D65012611B4#E5441226-CEAC-4F5F-84A5-FD7AEBFF3CEA" data-url="https://docs.craft.do/editor/d/4ebbb84e-8aca-be8a-3f1a-37ed54e0241f/82FCE7E9-0302-486D-A302-7DC2ECB1551F/b/54049712-BCCF-44CA-877C-7D65012611B4#E5441226-CEAC-4F5F-84A5-FD7AEBFF3CEA"><span>数据源</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>Arc 浏览器 ｜</span><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a/create/arc.net" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a/create/arc.net"><span>官网</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>Sizzy 浏览器｜</span><a href="https://sizzy.co/" data-url="https://sizzy.co/"><span>官网</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>zeroG 浏览器｜</span><a href="https://moonvy.com/zeroG" data-url="https://moonvy.com/zeroG"><span>官网</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>// 佐声道制作团队</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>文字版编辑 - Fiona</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>封面设计 - Rather</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>音频剪辑/后期 - Cali</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>听众反馈或话题投稿与建议：hi@kjsyp.fm</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听友 Discord 社区 </span><a href="https://discord.gg/VY4EeeEf62" data-url="https://discord.gg/VY4EeeEf62"><span>discord.gg</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎订阅「科技双眼啤」并关注我们 </span><a href="http://kjsyp.fm/" data-url="http://kjsyp.fm/"><span>kjsyp.fm</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>「公众号」搜索 zoundfm 即可关注，我们也会同步发文字版的播客哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在此奉上20个 Arc 邀请码名额（先到先得）：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://arc.net/gift/b34c7f82" data-url="https://arc.net/gift/b34c7f82"><span>arc.net</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://arc.net/gift/b4eb5d73" data-url="https://arc.net/gift/b4eb5d73"><span>arc.net</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://arc.net/gift/14a893d3" data-url="https://arc.net/gift/14a893d3"><span>arc.net</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://arc.net/gift/e154277c" data-url="https://arc.net/gift/e154277c"><span>arc.net</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>收听渠道</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://apple.co/3cqvAGm" data-url="https://apple.co/3cqvAGm"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a" data-url="https://xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a"><span>小宇宙</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>RSS直接订阅: </span><a href="https://kjsyp.fm/feed" data-url="https://kjsyp.fm/feed"><span>https://kjsyp.fm/feed</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/4vpLJCVh64qh4MOgvHwPeE" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/4vpLJCVh64qh4MOgvHwPeE"><span>Spotify</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9ranN5cC5mbS9mZWVk" data-url="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9ranN5cC5mbS9mZWVk"><span>Google Podcast</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/70432819" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/70432819"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
