  <item>
    <title>Ep.5 一起聊聊团队协同（ft. 陈皓 - MegaEase 创始人）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6347b860e67030aadb38f551</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6347b860e67030aadb38f551</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Oct 2022 07:03:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>// 关于</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>「佐声道」出品的科技双眼啤，由开发者Cali与设计师Rather共同主持，我们是从设计到开发等不同的视角对互联网软件硬件进行深入探讨的科技播客。佐声道主理人 Cali 在留美期间有丰富的工作经验，对于产品有极度的热爱以及不同的体验经历；设计师 Rather 一直在国内从事着UI设计师的工作，并在这一行有着不同的独特见解。同为苹果粉的两人一拍即合，他们也将自己对于产品的解读认知、对设计的严谨态度都延续到了他们所有的节目当中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是 【Slack vs 飞书】豪华加餐，非常高兴与荣幸能请到 MegaEase 创始人</span><a href="https://coolshell.cn/haoel" data-url="https://coolshell.cn/haoel"><strong><span>陈皓</span></strong></a><span>来到我们节目做客聊聊关于团队协作相关话题的看法。这次不局限于 Slack，飞书这些关于工具产品的外在功能呈现，更多的是聊聊内在关于企业价值，企业文化，协同内在的一些核心看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这段谈话里，可以发现一些，为什么20多年陈皓依旧在互联网与开发的前沿地带，为什么走上创业并能组建很 cool 的团队，为什么对创造价值这件事情上那么执着？</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾介绍：陈皓曾在 Amazon、IBM、Alibaba 从事软件开发相关工作，超过20多年的软件开发经验，资深技术专家，MegaEase 创始人，致力于为企业的高并发高可用架构提供一整套的技术解决方案和产品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>配合本期录制的播客，陈皓也写了一篇文章欢迎大家一起加入讨论：</span><a href="https://coolshell.cn/articles/22298.html" data-url="https://coolshell.cn/articles/22298.html"><strong><span>聊聊团队协同和协同工具</span></strong></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmsy5EV2HjXKnFT-LPacOvG92kkV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>// 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:00:14</a> </span></strong><span>开瓶开启畅聊模式</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">00:03:36</a> </span></strong><span>Slack 与飞书最大的不同点回顾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">00:11:54</a> 到底什么是团队协同？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">00:21:42</a> 企业的不信任文化驱动了产品功能</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">00:28:18</a> 开会的目的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">00:36:50</a> Demo Day 与 Workshop 研讨会文化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">00:52:29</a> 什么才是最好的协同工具</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3544">00:59:04</a> 协同工具中的小扳手</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3747">01:02:27</a> 如何更好地支持团队协同</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4220">01:10:20</a> 在线协同软件致命的弱点</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4739">01:18:59</a> IM 软件所缺少的多维度方面</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5030">01:23:50</a> 做游戏一样地做产品</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>// 相关链接</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>陈皓：</span><a href="https://coolshell.cn/haoel" data-url="https://coolshell.cn/haoel"><strong><span>官网</span></strong></a><strong><span>｜</span></strong><a href="https://twitter.com/haoel" data-url="https://twitter.com/haoel"><strong><span>Twitter</span></strong></a><strong><span>｜</span></strong><a href="https://weibo.com/haoel" data-url="https://weibo.com/haoel"><strong><span>微博</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2541">00:42:21</a> </span></strong><span>Rather 举办的佐玩「快门之前」研讨会：</span><a href="https://twitter.com/calicastlemusic/status/1580439938163945472?s=61&amp;t=cy151zjQnZZuiO1e2R1Ptg" data-url="https://twitter.com/calicastlemusic/status/1580439938163945472?s=61&amp;t=cy151zjQnZZuiO1e2R1Ptg"><strong><span>Twitter</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4643">01:17:23</a> </span></strong><span>Rather 提到的文章：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dfy4kKMundeMJwrO8y-SpA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dfy4kKMundeMJwrO8y-SpA"><strong><span>卷宗独家对话灵动岛设计师：解密 Apple 最好的创意、设计与团队</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4481">01:14:41</a> </span></strong><span>陈皓提到的视频：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RoA65-vLV_0" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RoA65-vLV_0"><strong><span>Google Docs 小技巧</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>// 佐声道制作团队</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>文案/运营 - Fiona</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>封面设计 - Rather</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>音频剪辑/后期 - Cali</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>听众反馈或话题投稿与建议：hi@kjsyp.fm</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>加入听友 Discord 社区 </span></strong><a href="https://discord.gg/VY4EeeEf62" data-url="https://discord.gg/VY4EeeEf62"><strong><span>discord.gg</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅「科技双眼啤」并关注我们</span></strong><a href="http://kjsyp.fm/" data-url="http://kjsyp.fm/"><strong><span> kjsyp.fm</span></strong></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://apple.co/3cqvAGm" data-url="https://apple.co/3cqvAGm"><strong><span>Apple Podcast</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a" data-url="https://xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a"><strong><span>小宇宙</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>RSS直接订阅:</span></strong><a href="https://kjsyp.fm/feed" data-url="https://kjsyp.fm/feed"><strong><span> https://kjsyp.fm/feed</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/4vpLJCVh64qh4MOgvHwPeE" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/4vpLJCVh64qh4MOgvHwPeE"><strong><span>Spotify</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9ranN5cC5mbS9mZWVk" data-url="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9ranN5cC5mbS9mZWVk"><strong><span>Google Podcast</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/70432819" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/70432819"><strong><span>喜马拉雅</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
