    <title>Ep.1 为什么从美国回来创业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6301f1f98063c4980da9806b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6301f1f98063c4980da9806b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Aug 2022 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>// 关于</span></h2><span></span><p><span>科技双眼啤是一档由开发者 Cali &amp; 设计师 Rather 共同主持的科技播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们尝试从不同的视角探索科技的海洋，同时对各种各样在改变我们生活方式的产品进行深入的探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目中，我们将具体聊聊看 Cali 是如何从出国留学转变成游戏开发者再最后到现在回国创业的历程，同时也跟 Rather 进行亲身经历过国内不同的公司所存在的差异进行探讨。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgjMxs-vMDReD3vu0YvMvsLf96EV.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>// 时间轴</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 在美国不同的工作氛围</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> 早上起床不一样的动力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 在小规模公司的好处</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> 美国一些公司的价值导向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 国内不同公司的价值导向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> 小公司的画饼原则</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a> 在美找工作面试难题</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 在美的第一份工作</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 在美职业低谷期</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 多次被裁的不平等遭遇</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 阳光总在风雨后（鸡汤时间）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> 为什么选择回国创业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 从游戏开发战略转向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 在国内组建志同道合的团队</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">26:36</a> 与过去国内产品团队的差异</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 之前在国内工作差别最大的地方</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 面临工作超纲的挑战</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2014">33:34</a> 开发的“甩锅”文化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">35:51</a> 做管理应该拥抱改变</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>// 相关信息</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>very very spaceship: </span><a href="https://vvspaceship.website/" data-url="https://vvspaceship.website/"><span>vvspaceship.website</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>// 佐声道制作团队</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>灯光/摄像/布景 - Fiona</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>封面设计 - Rather</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>音频剪辑/后期 - Cali</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpVI34ZXnRRsh6uLiV3s7EZZnq5P.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>听众反馈或话题投稿与建议：</span><a href="mailto:hi@kjsyp.fm"><span>hi@kjsyp.fm</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎订阅「科技双眼啤」并关注我们 kjsyp.fm</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://apple.co/3cqvAGm" data-url="https://apple.co/3cqvAGm"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>RSS直接订阅: </span><a href="https://kjsyp.fm/feed" data-url="https://kjsyp.fm/feed"><span>https://kjsyp.fm/feed</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/4vpLJCVh64qh4MOgvHwPeE" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/4vpLJCVh64qh4MOgvHwPeE"><span>Spotify</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/ool6bGypFDO6A5HguNIBzw" data-url="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/ool6bGypFDO6A5HguNIBzw"><span>Google Podcast</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a" data-url="https://xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6301f1f98063c4980da9806a"><span>小宇宙</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/70432819" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/70432819"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
